abstract: "A curated collection of 36 real-world problem statements for hackathons, capstone projects, and open-source contributions. Each problem is grounded in peer-reviewed research with linked datasets, affected stakeholder analysis, MVP scope, and risk assessment. Covers global health, agriculture, governance, water, education, legal access, and India-specific civic tech across 4 tracks: Global South Impact (10 AI/ML), US Civic Tech (10 LLM/data), India Impact (5 AI/agent), and Rapid Prototypes (11 non-AI engineering)."
